example:
订单服务按事件查表，条件里带起点：

```java
@Transactional
public boolean apply(String orderId, String event) {
  Transition t = table.get(event);
  int updated = orders.updateStatus(orderId, t.from(), t.to());
  if (updated == 1) events.insertOnce(orderId, event);
  return updated == 1;
}
```

```sql
UPDATE orders SET status = 'COMPLETED'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'SHIPPED';
UPDATE orders SET status = 'RETURNED'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'SHIPPED';
```

签收先提交后，第二条的 `status = SHIPPED` 已经不成立。若货在签收之后退回，改用：

```sql
UPDATE orders SET status = 'RETURNED'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'COMPLETED';
```

这一条的事件是顾客退回，不是把退货入库再执行一遍。
